    {
      "agent_candidates": [],
      "codex_accepted": null,
      "codex_clinical_checks": {},
      "frozen_excerpt": "严重不良事件，指参与者接受试验用药品后出现死亡、危及生命、永久或者严重的残疾或者功能丧失、参与者需要住院治疗或者延长住院时间，以及先天性异常或者出生缺陷等不良医学事件。",
      "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
      "role": "attached",
      "source_ref": "body.p996",
      "structure_unit_id": "su-f5cd3f88b671362f6f8f4dc4"
    },
    {
      "agent_candidates": [],
      "codex_accepted": null,
      "codex_clinical_checks": {},
      "frozen_excerpt": "严重不良事件（Serious Adverse Event，SAE）是指符合下列标准任何一项的不良事件：",
      "lookup": "frozen_plan_owned",
      "role": "attached",
      "source_ref": "body.p997",
